@startuml
' rfs-diagram: applog-visualization
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

left to right direction
file "recording.mcap" as MCAP
file "rfs_sim 的 CSV" as CSV
component "Foxglove / Lichtblick" as FG
component "PlotJuggler" as PJ

MCAP --> FG : 3D 轨迹、障碍物、规划路径；曲线；日志
MCAP --> PJ : 2D 曲线
CSV --> PJ : 现在就能用，无需写代码
@enduml
